WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:06.060
Hi everyone, how are you? Today I'll show you how to refund a customer

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.960
when there's an issue with a stuck power bank.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:15.780
If the customer pays and the power bank gets stuck for any reason

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.180
or the customer can't pull it out for some other reason

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:27.300
and the 5-minute free window ends, our platform charges the hourly rate — currently R$ 9.99.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:37.520
If that happens, you can come to the system and refund the amount the customer was charged.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.120
Open the "Details" option.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.520
Scroll down and click "Refund".

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.680
Then enter the refund reason here.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:51.840
If the reason is a stuck power bank, write that the power bank got stuck

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.020
and the customer couldn't pull it out. Click "Confirm".

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:59.680
This status will then show up:

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:02.500
"After-sales — pending".

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.680
After a while, the customer receives the refund in the registered PIX key.
